# Six notes at once on the music player: more notes than sampled channels (allocation ties by rank).
TRACK
PROGRAM 0
VOLUME 100
NOTE 48 c4 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 e4 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 g4 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 c5 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 e5 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 g5 v100
WAIT 4
NOTE 48 c6 v100
WAIT 60
NOTE 24 c4
NOTE 24 d4
NOTE 24 e4
NOTE 24 f4
NOTE 24 g4
NOTE 24 a4
WAIT 30
END
TRACK
PROGRAM 2
VOLUME 100
PRIORITY 0
NOTE 96 c3 v100
WAIT 96
END
TRACK
PROGRAM 9
VOLUME 100
NOTE 48 c3 v100
WAIT 96
END
